{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>ולא</b> — like <b>לא נשוב</b>, for the ḥolam and shureq interchange: <b>יקום אבי</b>, and <b>יקום</b> to the voice of a bird. Or it may be a word <b>נסוג</b> as a past-tense verb, like singular form from the root of <b>נכונו ללצים שפטים</b>. The meaning: He will turn to the son of man mentioned above, and when Your hand is his help, then You will give life to us all."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 80, :notes {0 "The comment cites forms (יקום אבי, נכונו ללצים שפטים) that do not match this verse or Psalm 80:19 as printed; they may reflect a corrupt transmission or citations from other verses, rendered hyper-literally as they stand."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:35:40.350957305Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}